    {
      "id": 8231944159285,
      "title": "R-Type DX - Collector’s Edition (GBC)",
      "handle": "r-type-dx-collector-s-edition-gbc",
      "body_html": "<p><em>R-Type DX - Collector’s Edition. This is an open pre-order for a limited time.</em></p>\n<ul></ul>\n<ul></ul>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p1\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Strike at the heart of the Bydo Empire in R-Type DX!</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">One of the most popular arcade shoot ‘em ups, R-Type is a huge game with difficult stages and monstrous bosses.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>In the early 1990s, Irem brought the first two entries to the small, monochrome screen of the Game Boy, both technical marvels.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>With the Game Boy Color, Irem combined those two games along with color-enhanced versions into an action-packed cartridge in R-Type DX in 1999.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Now, we are bringing this classic back along with music releases on vinyl and CD.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Prepare to blast through waves of aliens to protect Earth from the Bydo Empire!</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<strong>PRE-ORDERS CLOSE ON SUNDAY, NOVEMBER 1, 2026, AT 11:59 PM EASTERN TIME.</strong>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h6><br></h6>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
